{
    "title": "Word Cross - Crossword Puzzle",
    "description": "<b>Word Cross</b> is a great crossword puzzle game which can improve your vocabulary, train your brain, and relax your mind! \r\n\r\n<b>Word Cross</b> has more than 10000+ crossword puzzles. When you play this word connect puzzle game, you will reviews many words and train your brain.\r\n\r\nThis crossword is also more interesting than other ones with many different features besides crossword:\r\n<b>Help the girls</b>: in this Word Cross, there are many children and girls in trouble, they need your help. You can help them by playing this crossword puzzle game.\r\n<b>Quiz games</b>: Word Cross also has quiz games, these quiz games are unlocked when you finish each five or ten crossword puzzles, these quiz games are really interesting.\r\n<b>Quote event</b>: This quote event will show you many quotes by famous people, they are very meaningful.\r\n<b>Jigsaw event</b>: a jigsaw event in this word. When you playing the crossword puzzle game, you will collect jigsaw pieces, when all jigsaw pieces are collected, you will get a beautiful picture.\r\n<b>Decorate</b>: You can also decorate home and gardens in this word puzzle game.\r\n<b>Daily Challenge</b>: If you like challenges of crossword game, this daily challenge feature should be a good choice.\r\n<b>Beautiful backgrounds</b>: there are hundreds of beautiful backgrounds waiting for you to unlock and collect.\r\n<b>Game props</b>: many game props to help you when you are in a jam of Word Cross puzzles, such as word hints, letter shuffle and so on.\r\n\r\n<b>Word Cross</b> is a really fun word puzzle game, it is very interesting. Let's install it and have fun with crossword!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Word Cross</b> is a great crossword puzzle game which can improve your vocabulary, train your brain, and relax your mind! <br><br><b>Word Cross</b> has more than 10000+ crossword puzzles. When you play this word connect puzzle game, you will reviews many words and train your brain.<br><br>This crossword is also more interesting than other ones with many different features besides crossword:<br><b>Help the girls</b>: in this Word Cross, there are many children and girls in trouble, they need your help. You can help them by playing this crossword puzzle game.<br><b>Quiz games</b>: Word Cross also has quiz games, these quiz games are unlocked when you finish each five or ten crossword puzzles, these quiz games are really interesting.<br><b>Quote event</b>: This quote event will show you many quotes by famous people, they are very meaningful.<br><b>Jigsaw event</b>: a jigsaw event in this word. When you playing the crossword puzzle game, you will collect jigsaw pieces, when all jigsaw pieces are collected, you will get a beautiful picture.<br><b>Decorate</b>: You can also decorate home and gardens in this word puzzle game.<br><b>Daily Challenge</b>: If you like challenges of crossword game, this daily challenge feature should be a good choice.<br><b>Beautiful backgrounds</b>: there are hundreds of beautiful backgrounds waiting for you to unlock and collect.<br><b>Game props</b>: many game props to help you when you are in a jam of Word Cross puzzles, such as word hints, letter shuffle and so on.<br><br><b>Word Cross</b> is a really fun word puzzle game, it is very interesting. Let&#39;s install it and have fun with crossword!",
